            {
                "entry_id": "2388e661-f36b-36cc-9413-95a470362c6b",
                "word": "tegennatuurlijk",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30e345a1-b9a9-3b62-bd3e-6bd065dd7869",
                        "entry_id": "2388e661-f36b-36cc-9413-95a470362c6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "tegen de natuur in"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ad57afc-930d-4d00-895d-3cc130d4d3c0",
                                "sense_id": "30e345a1-b9a9-3b62-bd3e-6bd065dd7869",
                                "text": "Sommige van deze dansbewegingen zijn tegennatuurlijk en moeten aangepast worden, anders kunnen we het niet uitvoeren."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3c9f356a-9a0c-4a5e-bc1a-d142cf445ef5",
                        "source_entry_id": "2388e661-f36b-36cc-9413-95a470362c6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "30e345a1-b9a9-3b62-bd3e-6bd065dd7869",
                        "source_sense_description": "tegen de natuur in",
                        "target_lang_word": "widernatürlich",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "widernatürlich",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6caf4fa1-6343-3622-ae99-5e0243d08f63",
                                        "entry_id": "d0222ed9-3a13-3fa5-9eda-5d1753a91a64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "so, dass es in negativer Art und Weise vom Bekannten, Natürlichen, Normalen abweicht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c6f3df0-3b16-437e-9675-5a435e05a653",
                                                "sense_id": "6caf4fa1-6343-3622-ae99-5e0243d08f63",
                                                "text": "„Die widernatürliche Unzucht, welche zwischen Personen männlichen Geschlechts oder von Menschen mit Thieren verübt wird, ist mit Gefängniß zu bestrafen; …“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2f2cd32e-febb-4ad2-8ca1-1c3448ec60d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "2388e661-f36b-36cc-9413-95a470362c6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "30e345a1-b9a9-3b62-bd3e-6bd065dd7869",
                        "source_sense_description": "tegen de natuur in",
                        "target_lang_word": "unnatural",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unnatural",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ee7d1f1-7c38-3b5f-a318-e5d0291c5f29",
                                        "entry_id": "93e5a51a-8fee-389e-a20d-72f827d250ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not natural."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5818ff37-029f-3e7d-8ab1-9c188f42c988",
                                        "entry_id": "93e5a51a-8fee-389e-a20d-72f827d250ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not occurring in nature, the environment or atmosphere"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f06ea7e-c0f0-3de6-be5f-8dbac9be4eb4",
                                        "entry_id": "93e5a51a-8fee-389e-a20d-72f827d250ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Going against nature; perverse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00c453e5-0d7f-4cb7-89cc-2538dbb5098e",
                                                "sense_id": "6f06ea7e-c0f0-3de6-be5f-8dbac9be4eb4",
                                                "text": "Time wore heavily on with Winnie Santon, after Natalie had left them. Left as she was, much in her unnatural mother's society, who seemed to be never more pleased than when she might thwart her designs, or, in some manner act so as to make those about her uncomfortable, it was not to be wondered at, if she did sigh for other days, and a confidant, to whom she might unburden her heart."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d242b89b-51aa-404c-8fde-f8bc9d74c171",
                                                "sense_id": "6f06ea7e-c0f0-3de6-be5f-8dbac9be4eb4",
                                                "text": "One mother, when she heard that her daughter intended to take up medicine, retired to her room and wept, bewailing the fact that she had given birth to an \"unnatural daughter.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "unnatural",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f059646e-5549-3358-bbd7-2a37079a4188",
                                        "entry_id": "a1b1169b-6aa1-36ab-bba7-d61e2d9e4837",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is unnatural, against nature, perverse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a23f825c-2b2b-4e88-bb00-d7055fb8ac8e",
                                                "sense_id": "f059646e-5549-3358-bbd7-2a37079a4188",
                                                "text": "In the so-called \"golden era\" of science fiction, gay/lesbian characters were treated as misfits, sociopaths, villains and \"unnaturals\" to be pitied and scorned. Gay characters were virtually all weak, effeminate snivelers out to harm the heroes of the story. Lesbians were invariably portrayed as massive, muscular Amazons with sadistic tendencies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06a73267-cb34-4521-9ed8-20888bc4d4f0",
                                                "sense_id": "f059646e-5549-3358-bbd7-2a37079a4188",
                                                "text": "Deviants, heretics, pinks, false prophets and other unnaturals will not be spared the rod nor the stark fist of removal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6a5f134-bbad-47c3-87d9-f1d1eede95c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "2388e661-f36b-36cc-9413-95a470362c6b",
                        "source_sense_id": "30e345a1-b9a9-3b62-bd3e-6bd065dd7869",
                        "source_sense_description": "tegen de natuur in",
                        "target_lang_word": "contre nature",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "contre nature",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4a32d7c-4729-33d0-92e4-b953a6571b97",
                                        "entry_id": "1bd952f6-ba45-3ee0-b667-559ce294f24f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Monstrueux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce7b31e9-9258-4d0d-844d-4351983b3e93",
                                                "sense_id": "a4a32d7c-4729-33d0-92e4-b953a6571b97",
                                                "text": "Cet animal a une conformation contre nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67fbc165-87e7-4a24-911b-d1c8d81193dd",
                                                "sense_id": "a4a32d7c-4729-33d0-92e4-b953a6571b97",
                                                "text": "Le Démon se manifeste nuitamment, profitant du sommeil de notre raison pour nous souffler des comportements contre nature. L’insomnie est donc un remède souverain contre lui."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                        "entry_id": "1bd952f6-ba45-3ee0-b667-559ce294f24f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Réputé contraire à l’ordre naturel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76047471-5290-4fe9-898d-55787ddddcdb",
                                                "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                                "text": "Avoir des goûts contre nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9427dae-8908-4893-bc83-a4e41462fee9",
                                                "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                                "text": "Mais souvenez-vous bien, fille de Satan ! que les désirs contre nature ne sont jamais assouvis. Vous rencontrerez la désespérance au moment où vous croirez au bonheur !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a464c299-bd55-4db1-85ab-43f560338b39",
                                                "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                                "text": "Que le mariage bourgeois soit une institution contre nature, son cas suffirait à m’en convaincre. L’alliance passée à son doigt l’avait autorisée à connaître le plaisir ; ses sens étaient devenus exigeants ; à trente-cinq ans, dans la force de l’âge, il ne lui était plus permis de les assouvir."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6cba4b4-d64b-49b3-a905-8184116b6743",
                                                "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                                "text": "Quand il se retrouva dans sa chambre, il était définitivement rassuré. Néanmoins il songea longtemps, dans son lit, au tragique isolement de ceux qui, bravant les interdits de la société, poursuivent l’assouvissement d’une passion contre nature."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1023ba92-baf6-4ef1-a56a-f6e82a75175b",
                                                "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                                "text": "— Il n’y a pas à vous excuser, mais je n’aime pas parler de ces choses.\n— Elles se rattachent pourtant à toute cette histoire, à toute cette dispute. Oui, à ce que M. le Maire appelle « le péché contre nature » qu’est le célibat forcé…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "312ae619-17bf-48d9-a52b-056cbd7b5c80",
                                                "sense_id": "1f78e141-1ae9-3e8e-a6f1-9d5bcc1ca47e",
                                                "text": "Les juges de la Cour suprême de Delhi ont jugé illégal un vieil article du code pénal sur le « sexe contre nature ». L’homosexualité reste criminalisée dans 71 pays de la planète."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
